  "excerpts": "Proclamation 10976 of September 29, 2025 \n Adjusting Imports of <span class=\"match\">Timber</span>, Lumber, and Their Derivative Products Into the United States \n \n A Proclamation \n 1. On July 1, 2025, the Secretary of Commerce (Secretary) transmitted to me a report on his investigation into the effects of imports of <span class=\"match\">timber</span>, lumber, and their derivative products (collectively, wood products) on the national security of the United States under section 232 of the Trade Expansion Act of 1962, as amended, 19 U.S.C. 1862 (section 232). Based on the facts considered in that investigation",
